  _name: Level 2-4
  _isInteractable: 1
  _lines:
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: Love to see a job well done!
    modifiers:
    - type: 1
      value: 0.02
      triggerOrder: 0
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: Now, these gray rocks are good and all... but they're also kinda ugly,
      right?
    modifiers: []
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: This rock pile is gonna be tall, it should not be an eyesore, you understand.
    modifiers: []
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: 'So... I got these gold diamonds that  I - uh- found in a bank somewhere. '
    modifiers:
    - type: 3
      value: 0.3
      triggerOrder: 9
    - type: 3
      value: 0.3
      triggerOrder: 10
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: I'm throwing them in as well, however...
    modifiers: []
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: 'They take a little longer to land. '
    modifiers: []
  - name: Marc Brownie
    sentence: They're just lighter I suppose? Lemme show you!
    modifiers: []
